# src/apps/daemon/internal/networking/diagnostics

## Purpose
Network diagnosis and analysis owner: censorship diagnosis, clean-IP probing, IP posture, CDN/anti-bot inspection, TLS/SNI/HTTP/throughput checks, and result interpretation.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `networking` (rank 2; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

## Contents
- Direct files (30): `adaptive_mtu.go`, `adaptive_mtu_test.go`, `censorship_prober.go`, `censorship_prober_test.go`, `dns_battery.go`, `dns_battery_test.go`, `doh_fallback.go`, `doh_fallback_test.go`, `dynamic_proxy_validator.go`, `dynamic_proxy_validator_test.go`, `edge_gateway_health.go`, `edge_gateway_health_test.go` …

## Interfaces and dependencies
- Go package: `diagnostics`.
- Notable exported surface: `AdaptiveMtuDiscovery`, `BatteryMeta`, `BatteryResult`, `CensorshipAnomaly`, `CensorshipProber`, `CensorshipSignature`, `DNSSECTestDomain`, `DNSSECTestResult`, `DNSScanner`, `DiversityMetrics` …
- Daemon-local dependencies: none.
- Direct daemon callers: `internal/networking/proxyconfig`, `internal/networking/routing`.

## Invariants
- `networking` code must not import a higher-rank daemon band.

